# Restpad demo: every core feature in one file.
# Click "▶▶ Send All" at the top, or "▶ Send Request" on any block.

@baseUrl = https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com

### Simple GET with headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Named request whose response feeds later requests
# @name firstPost
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/1

### Request chaining: reference the previous response
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{firstPost.response.body.$.userId}}

### POST with a JSON body and dynamic system variables
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sent from Restpad",
  "requestId": "{{$guid}}",
  "sentAt": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### Query continuation lines
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments
    ?postId=1
    &_limit=3

### Paste a curl command, it just works
curl -X POST {{baseUrl}}/posts -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"title":"from curl"}'

### Redirect control
# @no-redirect
GET https://httpbin.org/redirect/1
